                "comment": "oh my goooood it's been over a year but I can still remember how unbearable lectures were!! Yes, it is like listening to poetry, impossible to take notes. The textbook, however, was amazingly clear and enjoyable. I learned SO much...just not from Ned Blackhawk.",
